      "Language": "rus",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The aim of research was to study the frequency and character of clinical-endoscopial disturbances in gastroduodenal zone at 140 BA patients at different regimen of GKS therapy. The high frequency of GERD in BA patients at GKS therapy was established. The dependence of main respiratory simptoms of BA on GEFR, the intencity of cough and dyspnea were found out. Presence of GEFR at BA patients deteriorates patency of airways."},
